<div class="am2b">
  <div class="am2b__wrap">
    <div class="am2b__head">
      <span class="am2b__rule"></span>
      <span class="am2b__eyebrow">Together for less</span>
      <h2 class="am2b__title">Sets &amp; pairings</h2>
      <p class="am2b__sub">Choose your own sets and save. Keep more than one look on hand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="am2b__grid">
      <div class="am2b__card">
        <div class="am2b__ph"><span class="am2b__save">Save 15%</span><img src="https://am2luxe.com/cdn/shop/files/IMG_8695.jpg?v=1754705828&width=700" alt="Mother and Daughter set"></div>
        <div class="am2b__body"><h3>Mother &amp; Daughter</h3><p>Choose one signature set for you and one Little Glam set for her. Your picks, matching manicure nights.</p><div class="am2b__price">$21.25 <span>$25</span></div><a href="/collections/all" class="am2b__btn">Choose your sets</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="am2b__card">
        <div class="am2b__ph"><span class="am2b__save">Save 10%</span><img src="https://am2luxe.com/cdn/shop/files/Pink_Diamond_Dust_3.jpg?v=1754693163&width=700" alt="The Duo"></div>
        <div class="am2b__body"><h3>The Duo</h3><p>Choose any two signature sets and save. A pair of looks to rotate through the week.</p><div class="am2b__price">$28.80 <span>$32</span></div><a href="/collections/all" class="am2b__btn">Choose your sets</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="am2b__card">
        <div class="am2b__ph"><span class="am2b__save">Save 20%</span><img src="https://am2luxe.com/cdn/shop/files/IMG_8700.jpg?v=1764465703&width=700" alt="The Trio"></div>
        <div class="am2b__body"><h3>The Trio</h3><p>Choose any three signature sets and save. A full rotation of looks for the week ahead.</p><div class="am2b__price">$38.40 <span>$48</span></div><a href="/collections/all" class="am2b__btn">Choose your sets</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .am2b{--foil:linear-gradient(135deg,#8A6D2F,#D9BC75,#F4E7B8,#B8923F,#F0DB96,#9C7B3B,#D4B76A);background:#E9E2D4}
  .am2b__wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:92px 34px}
  .am2b__head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 50px}
  .am2b__rule{display:block;width:52px;height:2px;background:var(--foil);margin:0 auto 20px}
  .am2b__eyebrow{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.34em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--foil);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;color:transparent}
  .am2b__title{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:48px;color:#161311;margin:14px 0 12px}
  .am2b__sub{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:15px;color:#5B5349}
  .am2b__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px}
  .am2b__card{background:#FBF9F4;border:1px solid rgba(168,135,74,.35);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .am2b__ph{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;background:#E9E2D4}
  .am2b__ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
  .am2b__save{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;background:#F5F1E8;border:1px solid rgba(168,135,74,.6);color:#161311;font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px}
  .am2b__body{padding:28px 28px 32px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
  .am2b__body h3{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:26px;color:#161311;margin:0 0 10px}
  .am2b__body p{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:14px;color:#5B5349;flex:1;margin:0}
  .am2b__price{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-size:22px;color:#161311;margin:18px 0}
  .am2b__price span{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#5B5349;text-decoration:line-through;margin-left:8px}
  .am2b__btn{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;padding:15px;background:#161311;color:#F5F1E8;text-decoration:none;transition:all .25s ease}
  .am2b__btn:hover{background:#3A2F2A}
  @media(max-width:800px){.am2b__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto}.am2b__title{font-size:38px}}
</style>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "AM2 Bundles", "tag": "section", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "AM2 Bundles" }] }
{% endschema %}
